{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "mcp-excalidraw-server",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "t_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "The two readings — and they're opposites    ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_sub",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42,
      "y": 72,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Refreshing is neither bullish nor bearish on its own. It depends entirely on WHICH SIDE is doing it, and which way you want to go.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_frame",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 112,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 62,
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_frametx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "THE FRAME:  you are looking to go LONG.   Sellers rest ABOVE you — they are your opponent.   Buyers rest BELOW you — they are your side.    ",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_ch1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 60,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "SELLERS above you — YOUR OPPONENT"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_ch2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 60,
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "BUYERS below you — YOUR SIDE"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_rh1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 285,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 215,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "they are\nREFRESHING"
      },
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_rh2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 525,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 215,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "they STOP\nand step away"
      },
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c11",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 285,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 215,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c11h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 303,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "WAIT.  Do not buy.    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c11b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 340,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Your opponent is home and winning. Buyers keep\nhitting them and getting absorbed, and price cannot\nget back above the level.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c11q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 424,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"As long as the offer is refreshing, I'm expecting\nthis to find continuation [down].\"",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c12",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 285,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 215,
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c12h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 904,
      "y": 303,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "CONFIRMATION.  The floor is real.    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c12b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 904,
      "y": 340,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Support is being actively defended. Somebody is\nbuying every attempt to push the level lower, and\ncoming back for more each time.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c12q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 904,
      "y": 424,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Buy the pullback into it. Risk goes under the level.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c21",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 525,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 215,
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c21h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 543,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "THE TRIGGER.  Buy it.    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c21b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 580,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Your opponent just left. The wall is gone — the size\nstops coming back, and nobody is home to sell to\nyou any more.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c21q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 664,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"When do you step in? When they step away.\"",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.394Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c22",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 525,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 215,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c22h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 904,
      "y": 543,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "GET OUT.  The thesis is off.    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c22b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 904,
      "y": 580,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Your floor just disappeared while you were leaning\non it. Nobody is defending the level you are risking\nagainst.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_c22q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 904,
      "y": 664,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Worse still if sellers now step DOWN in front of price.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_bot",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 130,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8",
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_both",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 800,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "PUT SIMPLY    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_botb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 836,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "You want your opponent's orders to refresh right up until the moment you enter — and then you want them to vanish.\nRefreshing by YOUR side is confirmation.   Refreshing by the OTHER side is a stop sign.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-28T19:34:25.395Z",
      "version": 1
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
    "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff",
    "gridSize": null
  },
  "files": {}
}